                                        <h3>Furlenco or RentoMojo — which is bigger?</h3>
                                        <p>Both similar scale + independent competitors. Different positioning — Furlenco furniture depth. RentoMojo broader home + appliance.</p>
                                        <h3>Is rental D2C sustainable long-term?</h3>
